# Database PostgreSQL Rules

## Stack

- PostgreSQL 16+
- pgvector
- pg_trgm

## Rules

- Use migrations for schema changes.
- Use JSONB for flexible metadata.
- Add indexes for status, foreign keys, and frequently filtered fields.
- Store embedding in knowledge_chunks using vector(1024) for BGE-M3.
- Record content_hash to avoid duplicate embedding.
- Do not delete published knowledge silently; prefer archived or expired.

## Extensions

```sql
CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS vector;
CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS pg_trgm;
```
